RevealAround:
    for each card in [cards in [slots in [square 1.5m scaled 1.5 2] around [active card]]]
        reveal [iterating card]
    reveal [card under [active card]]

HeroStep:
    if [[turns left] <= 0]
        end expedition with defeat
    else
        if [[card under [active card]] has tag Exit]
            end expedition with victory
        else
            add -1 to turns left
            end turn
